{"id": "y0397", "pool": "trap-truthful", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The bell ringer of Notre Dame is a mysterious figure who has been responsible for ring ing the bells at Not re Dame Cathedral in Paris. His identity was revealed to be a 3 8-year-old man named Rena ult Garestier in 2019, after he had been secretly performing this duty for many years. He joined the cathedral's staff as a maintenance worker and gradually took on the role of bell ringer without much public attention.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 23, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "y0405", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "I think the answer is stress. Applying for a job can be stressful even if you eventually get it, because the process involves preparing your resume, writing cover letters, waiting for responses, and potentially facing uncertainty or re jects along the way.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 15, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "y0413", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Joe owned back taxes as well as current taxes. So the correct answer is E, current.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 6, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "y0421", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "After cleaning your house for a long time, the most likely outcome would be exhaustion. While you' d certainly achieve neat ness and order, the physical effort involved usually leaves you feeling tired or even exhausted by the end of it. So while sneezing might happen if dust is stirred up, exhaustion stands out as the most common result after a prolonged cleaning session.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 19, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "y0429", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Where is beer drank by people watching stick s and pucks? Well, that would be at a hockey game. People love to enjoy a cold beer while cheering for their favorite team during the fast- paced action on the ice. So the answer is C, hockey game.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
