{"id": "y0453", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, the answer is e. Department store. A department store is a big store that sell s many different things like clock s, clothing, and wrenches.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 8, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "y0461", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Dogs pant to cool down when it ’s hot outside. So the best answer here is A, outside. When dogs are out in the heat, they can't sweat like humans do. Instead, they pant to release excess body heat through their tongue s and mouths. This helps them stay comfortable even on warm days.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 8, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "y0469", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The correct answer is B, city. Police officers patrol a city to ensure public safety and enforce laws throughout the urban area they serve.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 9, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "y0477", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Mandy lived in a train station, so she was probably used to seeing trains come and go. Since she longed to see distant places, the most likely place she'd imagine going would be a big city like Europe. So I think the answer is D.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
