{"id": "y0565", "pool": "know-openbook", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Forests are home to many creatures. Among the options given, the correct answer is C, white-tailed animals. These can refer to species like deer or rabbits that live in forested areas. While giant fish and enormous crabs are not typically found in forest s unless near water sources, desert jack als belong to arid regions rather than forests. So, the best fit for a creature commonly associated with forests is option C.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 23, "carrier_ended": null}
